<h2>Combining Light Rail With Other Options</h2>
<p>Light rail is only one piece of the transit picture. Many neighborhoods without a station have frequent bus service, and the South Lake Union streetcar, King County Metro routes, and the West Seattle water taxi fill in other gaps. If light rail does not reach your workplace yet, a well-connected bus corridor may serve you just as well. You can explore regional transit options through <a href="https://kingcounty.gov/">King County</a>.</p>

